codex
Phase 2 report is written to [redux-framework-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/redux-framework-phase2.codex.json).

Result: `0` true positives, `5` rejected candidate groups, `1` out-of-scope framework note. The main recurring issue was weak AJAX auth logic, but every traced high-impact sink still required a user-scoped nonce that the bundled plugin only renders on admin-only Redux UI surfaces, so I did not confirm a Patchstack-eligible subscriber/unauth exploit path.

Verification: the JSON parses cleanly with `jq`.
